u}}e^{-i \ell 	heta} \mathrm d \mathrm{k} \mathrm d \mathrm{n} \mathrm d \mathrm{a} \ =& \int_{A} y^{1/2}\int_N k_{\ell,\ell}(\mathrm{a} \mathrm{n} ) \mathrm d \mathrm{n} y^{\overline{
